TOOL: create_payout
CONTRACT: Initiates an external payout to a connected bank account. amount (minor units) must be > 0 and <= the account's current available (settled, non-pending) balance; if rail is 'wire', amount must be >= 100000 (the wire minimum of 1000.00 in minor units).
PARAMS (JSON schema): {"destination_account": {"type": "string", "required": true}, "amount": {"type": "integer", "required": true, "max": 9999999999}, "currency": {"type": "string", "required": true, "enum": ["USD", "EUR", "GBP"]}, "rail": {"type": "string", "required": true, "enum": ["ach", "wire", "rtp"]}, "schedule": {"type": "string", "required": false, "enum": ["standard", "instant"]}}

