TOOL: quote_fx_conversion
CONTRACT: Returns a locked FX quote to convert between two currencies. sell_currency and buy_currency must differ, both must be in the supported set, and the quote_ttl_seconds must be between 30 and 900 (quotes shorter than 30s or longer than 15min are not honored).
PARAMS (JSON schema): {"sell_currency": {"type": "string", "required": true, "enum": ["USD", "EUR", "GBP", "JPY", "CHF"]}, "buy_currency": {"type": "string", "required": true, "enum": ["USD", "EUR", "GBP", "JPY", "CHF"]}, "sell_amount": {"type": "integer", "required": true, "max": 9999999999}, "quote_ttl_seconds": {"type": "integer", "required": true, "max": 3600}, "rate_type": {"type": "string", "required": false, "enum": ["mid", "guaranteed"]}}

