TOOL: set_canary_slo
CONTRACT: Sets the SLO gate for a canary. latency_p99_ms must be >= latency_p50_ms (the 99th percentile cannot be lower than the median), and error_rate_max must be in 0..100.
PARAMS (JSON schema): {"service": {"type": "string", "required": true}, "latency_p50_ms": {"type": "integer", "required": true, "max": 600000}, "latency_p99_ms": {"type": "integer", "required": true, "max": 600000}, "error_rate_max": {"type": "number", "required": true}}

